  "summary": "Bug: mailkit/render.py called escape(str(value)), and str() strips the Markup marker, so values already marked safe were escaped again. Fixed by calling escape(value) directly. make dev (pip install -e . from vendor/) succeeded, but MarkupSafe's C speedups extension failed to compile and it fell back to the pure-Python build. make test: 11 passed, 0 failed, including test_markup_values_are_not_double_escaped and test_unescaped_ampersand_in_markup. Setup also wrote the ignored mailkit.egg-info/ in the repo, plus pip's wheel cache and the venv site-packages."
